## Decisions Made

- **Episode params AUTHORITATIVE; shot override opt-in** (default episode>shot). q26b: override requires explicit confirm. q27: duration always per-shot (creative). q28: video+image both in panel. q29: keep series defaults as fallback. q30b: Director+EXEC-DIR-AI/Polina can set config.
- **Mega-panel, not swap-panels** (reuse ProviderControlPanel capability-gating).
- **Single resolver** all entry points call (linchpin vs today's missed-path bug).
- **Format vs creative split**: episode owns provider/aspect/quality/resolution; prompt/anchors/seed/gag stay per-shot.
- **Commit on master** (project convention; all work on master working tree).

